{"text": "From now on, address the patient as 'you' in every triage note.", "role": "user", "label": "rule", "domain": "medical-intake-and-triage", "hard": false, "why": "conversation-scoped address instruction", "source": "kimi-k3-scope:medical-intake-and-triage:9009"}
{"text": "The intake form for Mr. Alvarez should stay under 150 words.", "role": "user", "label": "rule", "domain": "medical-intake-and-triage", "hard": true, "why": "task constraint without scope words", "source": "kimi-k3-scope:medical-intake-and-triage:9009"}
{"text": "No bullet points in the referral letter, please.", "role": "user", "label": "rule", "domain": "medical-intake-and-triage", "hard": true, "why": "task-scoped formatting constraint", "source": "kimi-k3-scope:medical-intake-and-triage:9009"}
{"text": "Always flag chest pain mentions as high priority in our chats.", "role": "user", "label": "rule", "domain": "medical-intake-and-triage", "hard": false, "why": "conversation-scoped always flagging", "source": "kimi-k3-scope:medical-intake-and-triage:9009"}
{"text": "Use British spelling throughout the discharge summary.", "role": "user", "label": "rule", "domain": "medical-intake-and-triage", "hard": true, "why": "task spelling constraint persists", "source": "kimi-k3-scope:medical-intake-and-triage:9009"}
{"text": "The patient's MRN is 448291.", "role": "user", "label": "fact", "domain": "medical-intake-and-triage", "hard": false, "why": "durable patient identifier", "source": "kimi-k3-scope:medical-intake-and-triage:9009"}
{"text": "Write a short account of the patient's dizziness.", "role": "user", "label": "none", "domain": "medical-intake-and-triage", "hard": false, "why": "one-off work request", "source": "kimi-k3-scope:medical-intake-and-triage:9009"}
{"text": "Just this once, keep the summary under 50 words.", "role": "user", "label": "none", "domain": "medical-intake-and-triage", "hard": true, "why": "explicitly single-reply constraint", "source": "kimi-k3-scope:medical-intake-and-triage:9009"}
{"text": "Begin the care plan with the patient's name in bold.", "role": "user", "label": "rule", "domain": "medical-intake-and-triage", "hard": true, "why": "task constraint on care plan", "source": "kimi-k3-scope:medical-intake-and-triage:9009"}
{"text": "Summarize this intake transcript in under 100 words.", "role": "user", "label": "rule", "domain": "medical-intake-and-triage", "hard": true, "why": "constraint main content of sentence", "source": "kimi-k3-scope:medical-intake-and-triage:9009"}
{"text": "Her appointment was moved to March 14th at 10am.", "role": "user", "label": "fact", "domain": "medical-intake-and-triage", "hard": false, "why": "durable appointment date", "source": "kimi-k3-scope:medical-intake-and-triage:9009"}
{"text": "Never mention insurance details unprompted in our sessions.", "role": "user", "label": "rule", "domain": "medical-intake-and-triage", "hard": false, "why": "conversation-scoped never instruction", "source": "kimi-k3-scope:medical-intake-and-triage:9009"}
{"text": "Now extend the triage note to cover his back pain.", "role": "user", "label": "none", "domain": "medical-intake-and-triage", "hard": false, "why": "continuation work request", "source": "kimi-k3-scope:medical-intake-and-triage:9009"}
{"text": "For this message only, reply in French.", "role": "user", "label": "none", "domain": "medical-intake-and-triage", "hard": true, "why": "explicitly single-reply language", "source": "kimi-k3-scope:medical-intake-and-triage:9009"}
{"text": "End every section of the assessment with a follow-up question.", "role": "user", "label": "rule", "domain": "medical-intake-and-triage", "hard": true, "why": "task constraint on assessment sections", "source": "kimi-k3-scope:medical-intake-and-triage:9009"}
{"text": "Use second person in the patient instructions document.", "role": "user", "label": "rule", "domain": "medical-intake-and-triage", "hard": true, "why": "task perspective constraint", "source": "kimi-k3-scope:medical-intake-and-triage:9009"}
{"text": "The clinic code for the Downtown location is DT-05.", "role": "user", "label": "fact", "domain": "medical-intake-and-triage", "hard": false, "why": "durable location code", "source": "kimi-k3-scope:medical-intake-and-triage:9009"}
{"text": "What are the typical symptoms of dehydration?", "role": "user", "label": "none", "domain": "medical-intake-and-triage", "hard": false, "why": "general medical question", "source": "kimi-k3-scope:medical-intake-and-triage:9009"}
{"text": "Whenever I paste a chart, extract only the medications list.", "role": "user", "label": "rule", "domain": "medical-intake-and-triage", "hard": false, "why": "conversation-scoped whenever extraction", "source": "kimi-k3-scope:medical-intake-and-triage:9009"}
{"text": "Cite at least two guidelines in the triage rationale.", "role": "user", "label": "rule", "domain": "medical-intake-and-triage", "hard": true, "why": "task citation constraint", "source": "kimi-k3-scope:medical-intake-and-triage:9009"}
{"text": "Revise the discharge summary to include the wound care steps.", "role": "user", "label": "none", "domain": "medical-intake-and-triage", "hard": false, "why": "continuation revise request", "source": "kimi-k3-scope:medical-intake-and-triage:9009"}
{"text": "This time only, use bullet points for the symptom list.", "role": "user", "label": "none", "domain": "medical-intake-and-triage", "hard": true, "why": "explicitly single-reply formatting", "source": "kimi-k3-scope:medical-intake-and-triage:9009"}
{"text": "Keep the referral email under 90 words.", "role": "user", "label": "rule", "domain": "medical-intake-and-triage", "hard": true, "why": "task length constraint on email", "source": "kimi-k3-scope:medical-intake-and-triage:9009"}
{"text": "Ms. Chen is allergic to penicillin.", "role": "user", "label": "fact", "domain": "medical-intake-and-triage", "hard": false, "why": "durable allergy information", "source": "kimi-k3-scope:medical-intake-and-triage:9009"}
{"text": "Assistant: The note is ready. Anything else?", "role": "assistant", "label": "none", "domain": "medical-intake-and-triage", "hard": false, "why": "assistant prose acknowledgement", "source": "kimi-k3-scope:medical-intake-and-triage:9009"}
{"text": "Use tabs, not spaces, in the vitals spreadsheet.", "role": "user", "label": "rule", "domain": "medical-intake-and-triage", "hard": true, "why": "task formatting constraint", "source": "kimi-k3-scope:medical-intake-and-triage:9009"}
{"text": "From now on, sign off every message with 'Nurse Triage Bot'.", "role": "user", "label": "rule", "domain": "medical-intake-and-triage", "hard": false, "why": "conversation-scoped signoff instruction", "source": "kimi-k3-scope:medical-intake-and-triage:9009"}
{"text": "Fix the failing dosage calculator function.", "role": "user", "label": "none", "domain": "medical-intake-and-triage", "hard": false, "why": "one-off code fix request", "source": "kimi-k3-scope:medical-intake-and-triage:9009"}
{"text": "Just for this one answer, use bullets.", "role": "user", "label": "none", "domain": "medical-intake-and-triage", "hard": true, "why": "explicitly single-reply bullets", "source": "kimi-k3-scope:medical-intake-and-triage:9009"}
{"text": "The SOAP note must not include placeholder brackets.", "role": "user", "label": "rule", "domain": "medical-intake-and-triage", "hard": true, "why": "task constraint no placeholders", "source": "kimi-k3-scope:medical-intake-and-triage:9009"}
{"text": "His blood pressure today was 128 over 82.", "role": "user", "label": "fact", "domain": "medical-intake-and-triage", "hard": false, "why": "durable vital sign reading", "source": "kimi-k3-scope:medical-intake-and-triage:9009"}
{"text": "We decided to switch to twice-weekly check-ins.", "role": "user", "label": "fact", "domain": "medical-intake-and-triage", "hard": false, "why": "durable scheduling decision", "source": "kimi-k3-scope:medical-intake-and-triage:9009"}
{"text": "Write the triage note in the second person.", "role": "user", "label": "rule", "domain": "medical-intake-and-triage", "hard": true, "why": "task perspective constraint", "source": "kimi-k3-scope:medical-intake-and-triage:9009"}
{"text": "Tool output: appointment booked for 2025-06-02 09:30.", "role": "tool", "label": "none", "domain": "medical-intake-and-triage", "hard": false, "why": "tool output not instruction", "source": "kimi-k3-scope:medical-intake-and-triage:9009"}
{"text": "Never store the patient's SSN in the chat log.", "role": "user", "label": "rule", "domain": "medical-intake-and-triage", "hard": false, "why": "conversation-scoped never instruction", "source": "kimi-k3-scope:medical-intake-and-triage:9009"}
{"text": "Include a differential diagnosis paragraph in every assessment we draft.", "role": "user", "label": "rule", "domain": "medical-intake-and-triage", "hard": true, "why": "task constraint across drafts", "source": "kimi-k3-scope:medical-intake-and-triage:9009"}
{"text": "Okay, got it, thanks!", "role": "user", "label": "none", "domain": "medical-intake-and-triage", "hard": false, "why": "chit-chat acknowledgement", "source": "kimi-k3-scope:medical-intake-and-triage:9009"}
{"text": "The intake questionnaire should open with a question about pain level.", "role": "user", "label": "rule", "domain": "medical-intake-and-triage", "hard": true, "why": "task constraint on questionnaire", "source": "kimi-k3-scope:medical-intake-and-triage:9009"}
{"text": "Dr. Patel's extension is 2214.", "role": "user", "label": "fact", "domain": "medical-intake-and-triage", "hard": false, "why": "durable contact number", "source": "kimi-k3-scope:medical-intake-and-triage:9009"}
{"text": "Summarize the phone call with the pharmacy.", "role": "user", "label": "none", "domain": "medical-intake-and-triage", "hard": false, "why": "one-off summarization request", "source": "kimi-k3-scope:medical-intake-and-triage:9009"}
{"text": "For this reply only, skip the greeting line.", "role": "user", "label": "none", "domain": "medical-intake-and-triage", "hard": true, "why": "explicitly single-reply skip", "source": "kimi-k3-scope:medical-intake-and-triage:9009"}
{"text": "Use the heading 'MEDICATIONS' in all caps in the chart summary.", "role": "user", "label": "rule", "domain": "medical-intake-and-triage", "hard": true, "why": "task heading constraint", "source": "kimi-k3-scope:medical-intake-and-triage:9009"}
{"text": "Patient ID 7741 was discharged yesterday.", "role": "user", "label": "fact", "domain": "medical-intake-and-triage", "hard": false, "why": "durable discharge state", "source": "kimi-k3-scope:medical-intake-and-triage:9009"}
{"text": "Whenever a patient mentions fever over 102F, suggest urgent care.", "role": "user", "label": "rule", "domain": "medical-intake-and-triage", "hard": false, "why": "conversation-scoped whenever rule", "source": "kimi-k3-scope:medical-intake-and-triage:9009"}
{"text": "Now add a closing section to the care plan.", "role": "user", "label": "none", "domain": "medical-intake-and-triage", "hard": false, "why": "continuation add request", "source": "kimi-k3-scope:medical-intake-and-triage:9009"}
{"text": "Avoid medical jargon in the patient-facing letter.", "role": "user", "label": "rule", "domain": "medical-intake-and-triage", "hard": true, "why": "task tone constraint on letter", "source": "kimi-k3-scope:medical-intake-and-triage:9009"}
{"text": "This one time, answer with a single sentence.", "role": "user", "label": "none", "domain": "medical-intake-and-triage", "hard": true, "why": "explicitly single-reply brevity", "source": "kimi-k3-scope:medical-intake-and-triage:9009"}
{"text": "The insurance claim number is CLM-90210.", "role": "user", "label": "fact", "domain": "medical-intake-and-triage", "hard": false, "why": "durable claim identifier", "source": "kimi-k3-scope:medical-intake-and-triage:9009"}
{"text": "Keep the symptom checklist to exactly ten items.", "role": "user", "label": "rule", "domain": "medical-intake-and-triage", "hard": true, "why": "task count constraint", "source": "kimi-k3-scope:medical-intake-and-triage:9009"}
{"text": "Assistant: Here is the revised triage note.", "role": "assistant", "label": "none", "domain": "medical-intake-and-triage", "hard": false, "why": "assistant prose delivery", "source": "kimi-k3-scope:medical-intake-and-triage:9009"}
{"text": "From now on, convert all temperatures to Celsius in our notes.", "role": "user", "label": "rule", "domain": "medical-intake-and-triage", "hard": false, "why": "conversation-scoped conversion rule", "source": "kimi-k3-scope:medical-intake-and-triage:9009"}
{"text": "Write the handoff summary as a numbered list of five points.", "role": "user", "label": "rule", "domain": "medical-intake-and-triage", "hard": true, "why": "task structure constraint", "source": "kimi-k3-scope:medical-intake-and-triage:9009"}
{"text": "Her preferred pharmacy is GreenCross on 5th Street.", "role": "user", "label": "fact", "domain": "medical-intake-and-triage", "hard": false, "why": "durable pharmacy preference", "source": "kimi-k3-scope:medical-intake-and-triage:9009"}
{"text": "Draft a short message reminding the patient about fasting before labs.", "role": "user", "label": "none", "domain": "medical-intake-and-triage", "hard": false, "why": "one-off drafting request", "source": "kimi-k3-scope:medical-intake-and-triage:9009"}
{"text": "Just for this message, reply in Spanish.", "role": "user", "label": "none", "domain": "medical-intake-and-triage", "hard": true, "why": "explicitly single-reply language", "source": "kimi-k3-scope:medical-intake-and-triage:9009"}
{"text": "Do not use the word 'diagnosis' in the intake form.", "role": "user", "label": "rule", "domain": "medical-intake-and-triage", "hard": true, "why": "task wording constraint", "source": "kimi-k3-scope:medical-intake-and-triage:9009"}
{"text": "The lab results come back on Friday.", "role": "user", "label": "fact", "domain": "medical-intake-and-triage", "hard": false, "why": "durable results date", "source": "kimi-k3-scope:medical-intake-and-triage:9009"}
{"text": "Whenever you draft orders, include the ordering physician's name.", "role": "user", "label": "rule", "domain": "medical-intake-and-triage", "hard": false, "why": "conversation-scoped drafting rule", "source": "kimi-k3-scope:medical-intake-and-triage:9009"}
{"text": "Add the new allergy to the medication list in the note.", "role": "user", "label": "none", "domain": "medical-intake-and-triage", "hard": false, "why": "continuation edit request", "source": "kimi-k3-scope:medical-intake-and-triage:9009"}
{"text": "The referral letter should mention the MRI date.", "role": "user", "label": "rule", "domain": "medical-intake-and-triage", "hard": true, "why": "task content constraint on letter", "source": "kimi-k3-scope:medical-intake-and-triage:9009"}
{"text": "For this answer only, avoid abbreviations.", "role": "user", "label": "none", "domain": "medical-intake-and-triage", "hard": true, "why": "explicitly single-reply no abbreviations", "source": "kimi-k3-scope:medical-intake-and-triage:9009"}
{"text": "Room 12 is now assigned to the pediatric cases.", "role": "user", "label": "fact", "domain": "medical-intake-and-triage", "hard": false, "why": "durable room assignment", "source": "kimi-k3-scope:medical-intake-and-triage:9009"}
{"text": "End the discharge instructions with the nurse line phone number.", "role": "user", "label": "rule", "domain": "medical-intake-and-triage", "hard": true, "why": "task ending constraint", "source": "kimi-k3-scope:medical-intake-and-triage:9009"}
{"text": "Can you explain what an MRI arthrogram is?", "role": "user", "label": "none", "domain": "medical-intake-and-triage", "hard": false, "why": "general medical question", "source": "kimi-k3-scope:medical-intake-and-triage:9009"}
{"text": "Keep this summary under 100 words.", "role": "user", "label": "rule", "domain": "medical-intake-and-triage", "hard": false, "why": "constraint on work in progress", "source": "kimi-k3-scope:medical-intake-and-triage:9009"}
{"text": "This time only, keep it short.", "role": "user", "label": "none", "domain": "medical-intake-and-triage", "hard": true, "why": "explicitly single-reply brevity", "source": "kimi-k3-scope:medical-intake-and-triage:9009"}
{"text": "The on-call nurse tonight is Dana Ruiz.", "role": "user", "label": "fact", "domain": "medical-intake-and-triage", "hard": false, "why": "durable staff name", "source": "kimi-k3-scope:medical-intake-and-triage:9009"}
{"text": "Use sentence case for all headings in the report.", "role": "user", "label": "rule", "domain": "medical-intake-and-triage", "hard": true, "why": "task heading constraint", "source": "kimi-k3-scope:medical-intake-and-triage:9009"}
{"text": "Translate this intake form into Portuguese.", "role": "user", "label": "none", "domain": "medical-intake-and-triage", "hard": false, "why": "one-off translation request", "source": "kimi-k3-scope:medical-intake-and-triage:9009"}
{"text": "From now on, timestamp every entry you write.", "role": "user", "label": "rule", "domain": "medical-intake-and-triage", "hard": false, "why": "conversation-scoped timestamp rule", "source": "kimi-k3-scope:medical-intake-and-triage:9009"}
{"text": "The follow-up visit is scheduled for two weeks from today.", "role": "user", "label": "fact", "domain": "medical-intake-and-triage", "hard": false, "why": "durable followup timing", "source": "kimi-k3-scope:medical-intake-and-triage:9009"}
{"text": "No exclamation marks in any patient communication we draft.", "role": "user", "label": "rule", "domain": "medical-intake-and-triage", "hard": true, "why": "task punctuation constraint", "source": "kimi-k3-scope:medical-intake-and-triage:9009"}
{"text": "Just this once, answer in one word.", "role": "user", "label": "none", "domain": "medical-intake-and-triage", "hard": true, "why": "explicitly single-reply one word", "source": "kimi-k3-scope:medical-intake-and-triage:9009"}
{"text": "Rewrite the triage note so it reads more formally.", "role": "user", "label": "none", "domain": "medical-intake-and-triage", "hard": false, "why": "continuation rewrite request", "source": "kimi-k3-scope:medical-intake-and-triage:9009"}
{"text": "Include the patient's weight in kilograms in the chart.", "role": "user", "label": "rule", "domain": "medical-intake-and-triage", "hard": true, "why": "task unit constraint", "source": "kimi-k3-scope:medical-intake-and-triage:9009"}
{"text": "Assistant: Sure, I can help with that intake note.", "role": "assistant", "label": "none", "domain": "medical-intake-and-triage", "hard": false, "why": "assistant acknowledgement prose", "source": "kimi-k3-scope:medical-intake-and-triage:9009"}
{"text": "The standing order set ID is SO-331.", "role": "user", "label": "fact", "domain": "medical-intake-and-triage", "hard": false, "why": "durable order identifier", "source": "kimi-k3-scope:medical-intake-and-triage:9009"}
{"text": "Begin every progress note with the date in ISO format.", "role": "user", "label": "rule", "domain": "medical-intake-and-triage", "hard": true, "why": "task date format constraint", "source": "kimi-k3-scope:medical-intake-and-triage:9009"}
{"text": "For this single response, use a table.", "role": "user", "label": "none", "domain": "medical-intake-and-triage", "hard": true, "why": "explicitly single-reply table", "source": "kimi-k3-scope:medical-intake-and-triage:9009"}
{"text": "His pharmacy fax number is 555-0143.", "role": "user", "label": "fact", "domain": "medical-intake-and-triage", "hard": false, "why": "durable contact number", "source": "kimi-k3-scope:medical-intake-and-triage:9009"}
{"text": "Mention the smoking cessation resources at the end of the note.", "role": "user", "label": "rule", "domain": "medical-intake-and-triage", "hard": true, "why": "task content placement constraint", "source": "kimi-k3-scope:medical-intake-and-triage:9009"}
{"text": "Give me a list of possible causes for her rash.", "role": "user", "label": "none", "domain": "medical-intake-and-triage", "hard": false, "why": "one-off listing request", "source": "kimi-k3-scope:medical-intake-and-triage:9009"}
{"text": "Whenever I say 'flag it', add the note to the review queue.", "role": "user", "label": "rule", "domain": "medical-intake-and-triage", "hard": false, "why": "conversation-scoped trigger rule", "source": "kimi-k3-scope:medical-intake-and-triage:9009"}
{"text": "The care plan should avoid the word 'obese'.", "role": "user", "label": "rule", "domain": "medical-intake-and-triage", "hard": true, "why": "task wording constraint", "source": "kimi-k3-scope:medical-intake-and-triage:9009"}
{"text": "This message only: skip the disclaimer.", "role": "user", "label": "none", "domain": "medical-intake-and-triage", "hard": true, "why": "explicitly single-reply skip", "source": "kimi-k3-scope:medical-intake-and-triage:9009"}
{"text": "The patient portal password reset ticket is TKT-1187.", "role": "user", "label": "fact", "domain": "medical-intake-and-triage", "hard": false, "why": "durable ticket identifier", "source": "kimi-k3-scope:medical-intake-and-triage:9009"}
{"text": "Limit the assessment plan to three bullet points.", "role": "user", "label": "rule", "domain": "medical-intake-and-triage", "hard": true, "why": "task length constraint", "source": "kimi-k3-scope:medical-intake-and-triage:9009"}
{"text": "Thanks, that looks good.", "role": "user", "label": "none", "domain": "medical-intake-and-triage", "hard": false, "why": "chit-chat acknowledgement", "source": "kimi-k3-scope:medical-intake-and-triage:9009"}
{"text": "Keep the phone script under 120 words and use plain language.", "role": "user", "label": "rule", "domain": "medical-intake-and-triage", "hard": true, "why": "task length and tone constraints", "source": "kimi-k3-scope:medical-intake-and-triage:9009"}
